id: pmc-ytyb
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.10, take the auditor fixes the lockfile withheld, and guard them at consumer level"
description: "CI runs the repo-pinned binaries, so the pins decide what the gates exercise. Advance @unbrained/pm-cli from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.10 and pm-ops from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.9. The pm-ops range already read as a caret so this repository read as tracking the canonical publish-attestation auditor; it was not, because npm ci installs the lockfile. The CLI bump also surfaces one behaviour change: pm-cli 2026.9.8 fixed GH-1219 to report truthful package update coverage, so a package installed from a local directory now yields a partial-coverage warning where the deep doctor previously counted it as covered, and test/generator.test.ts asserted an empty warning list."
type: Chore
status: open
